{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":43,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"cbd895f0-5ccb-44c1-9eb9-082f444ad774","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561304824,"PostDateInt":1789365135000,"PostDate":"2026-09-14T13:52:15","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"资深失效分析工程师(J11558)","OrgId":2102765,"Org":"DRAM_失效分析组","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·中山市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 负责 DRAM / LPDDR 产品在研发、工程验证及量产阶段的eFA失效分析工作，定位失效原因并推动问题解决。\n2. 针对 ATE 测试、可靠性测试、客户退回及量产异常样品，开展电性失效分析和复测验证。\n3. 结合 ATE 测试数据、Fail Bitmap、测试 Pattern 及电性特征，分析 DRAM/LPDDR 常见失效模式。\n4. 协助测试开发、产品、工艺及质量团队处理量产测试异常、低良率及客诉问题。\n5. 使用 Python 或相关工具对测试数据、Fail Log 及失效数据进行统计分析和报告生成。\n6. 编写失效分析报告、技术总结及相关分析文档，持续完善失效分析流程。","Require":"1. 电子工程、微电子、集成电路、电子信息、计算机或相关专业本科及以上学历。\n2. 5 年以上半导体失效分析、测试开发或产品工程经验，有 DRAM / LPDDR / Flash 等存储器产品经验者优先。\n3. 熟悉 DRAM/LPDDR 基本架构、工作原理及常见失效模式。\n4. 熟悉存储器测试流程及 JEDEC 相关标准，了解 ATE 测试数据、Fail Log 和 Fail Bitmap 的分析方法。\n5. 具备电性失效分析能力，能够独立完成失效复测、条件验证和问题定位。\n6. 熟悉 Advantest T55xx/T58xx、Teradyne 等 ATE 测试平台者优先。\n7. 掌握 C 语言或 Python，能够进行数据处理、自动化分析及测试报告生成，具有开创精神使用AI负责工作。\n8. 具备良好的逻辑分析能力、沟通能力和团队协作精神。","ClassificationOne":"研发","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescript